  "evidencia": "Page: Vincent Walker. Sentence: Vincent Francis Walker (born March 2, 1980), better known as Vince Walker, is an American multi-instrumentalist, best known as the lead singer of third-wave ska band Suburban Legends.\nPage: David Usher. Sentence: David Usher (born April 24, 1966) is an English-born Canadian musician, best-selling author, keynote speaker and activist, known as the lead singer of the alternative rock band Moist.\nPage: Brian Robertson (trombonist). Sentence: Brian Robertson (born October 19, 1979) is the trombone player for the Orange County-based third-wave ska band Suburban Legends and, along with Vincent Walker, is one of the two members to have played with the band since its origin as Bomb Squad.\nPage: Wake Up and Say Goodbye. Sentence: Wake Up and Say Goodbye is the sixth album by solo artist David Usher, released on September 23, 2008.",
